00:16:55,296 --> 00:16:57,603
How come Rasool Allah ﷺ chose Al-Habasha(اَلْحَبَشَه).?

209
00:16:58,391 --> 00:17:04,231
Well, the number one reason  which is stated in the Hadith(حديث) is the saying of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

210
00:17:04,312 --> 00:17:07,638
فَاِنَّ بِهَا مَلِكْ لَا يُظْلَمُ عِنْدَه’ اَحَدْ

211
00:17:08,204 --> 00:17:12,410
Go to the Abyssinia because therein is a king who does not oppress anyone.

212
00:17:13,331 --> 00:17:20,391
Justice was the primary reason for the Muslims going to Al-Habasha(اَلْحَبَشَه), they were in search of justice,

213
00:17:21,204 --> 00:17:23,186
because they were fleeing persecution.

214
00:17:23,344 --> 00:17:28,199
So, they needed to go to a place where they will get justice, and that was Abyssinia.

215
00:17:29,672 --> 00:17:33,441
Second reason, which is a secondary reason,

216
00:17:34,382 --> 00:17:38,436
