217
00:17:39,501 --> 00:17:40,451
Number one,

218
00:17:40,635 --> 00:17:43,879
Quraish(قُرَيْشْ) used to have business with Abyssinia.

219
00:17:44,483 --> 00:17:47,120
That was one of the areas that they would do business with in winter.

220
00:17:47,176 --> 00:17:50,932
The people of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ) had two journeys, one in summer and one winter,

221
00:17:51,307 --> 00:17:56,849
the one in winter, one branch of it would go to Al-Habasha(اَلْحَبَشَه), Abyssinia.

222
00:17:57,056 --> 00:18:00,167
So, they already had an established commercial relationship.

223
00:18:01,188 --> 00:18:07,369
Number two, Rasool Allah ﷺ very early on was exposed to Abyssinian culture.

224
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:13,126
