00:19:21,256 --> 00:19:21,710
She said:

244
00:19:21,919 --> 00:19:23,353
سَبَّتَ اللهُ اَقْدَامَ كُمْ

245
00:19:23,535 --> 00:19:24,661
ثَبَّتَ اللهُ اَقْدَامَ كُمْ

246
00:19:24,701 --> 00:19:27,378
means may Allah make your feet firm.

247
00:19:27,945 --> 00:19:32,488
But rather than saying firm, she was saying Sabt(سَبْت) which means Saturday.

248
00:19:32,580 --> 00:19:34,635
Which means the whole sentence doesn't mean anything.

249
00:19:35,208 --> 00:19:36,365
Rasool Allah ﷺ told her:

250
00:19:36,410 --> 00:19:38,258
اُسْكُتِيْ فَاِنَّكَ اَسْرَءَ لِسَانْ

251
00:19:38,333 --> 00:19:41,051
Stay quiet, because you have a difficult tongue.

252
00:19:42,287 --> 00:19:44,809
So, she wasn't even able to get rid of her accent.

253
00:19:45,437 --> 00:19:48,271
And this was a person very close to Rasool Allah ﷺ

254
00:19:48,328 --> 00:19:55,747
